## Create a function in Java that takes array of integers and checks if it contains duplicates.

### Response
public static boolean containsDuplicates(int[] arr) {

    Set<Integer> set = new HashSet<Integers>();
    for(int i : arr) {
        if(set.contains(arr[i])) {
            return true;
        } else {
            set.add(i);
        }
    }
    return false;
}

